<title>ISRAEL: Elbit Medical Q2 EPS $0.12 vs $0.10.</title>
<headline>Elbit Medical Q2 EPS $0.12 vs $0.10.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Elbit Medical Imaging Ltd</p>
<p>			   (in millions of dollars except EPS)</p>
<p>			    Q2 97    Q2 96    6-MTH 97    6-MTH 96</p>
<p>Sales		     124.6    122.0    235.8	 241.9</p>
<p>Operating Profit	  5.4	1.6	8.5	   3.3</p>
<p>Net Profit		  2.5	2.2	2.7	   3.3</p>
<p>Earnings per share     0.12     0.10     0.12	  0.15</p>
<p>Number of shares     21,415   21,386   21,415	21,386</p>
<p>outstanding</p>
<p>(in thousands)</p>
<p>Note: The 1996 Q2 net profit included a one-time gain of $3.0 million.  </p>
<p>Elbit Medical said its second quarter results were affected by an operating improvement at its subsidiary Elscint in relation to previous quarters; a continuation in the trend of improved operations at its subsidiary Elbit Ultrasound; and continued erosion of the European currencies in relation to the dollar (the company operates in dollars).</p>
<p>-- Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211</p>
